{"id":"n69702-1-11","stage":5,"title":"위안 · 安慰","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69702-1-11-1","ko":"제가 도움이 못 되어서 죄송해요.","zh":"很抱歉，我没能帮上忙。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도움이","meaning":"帮助，帮忙，援助","explanation":"도움：帮助，帮忙，援助；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"도움","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64542","senseId":"1","lemma":"도움","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"못","meaning":"不会做动词所指的动作。","explanation":"못：不会做动词所指的动作。","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되어서","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"죄송해요.","meaning":"抱歉，愧疚","explanation":"죄송하다：抱歉，愧疚；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"죄송하다","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91763","senseId":"1","lemma":"죄송하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"8d901cc28dffe7ee","term":"도움","zh":"帮助，帮忙，援助","audio":"/audio/8d901cc28dffe7ee0af6.mp3","entryId":"64542","definition":"帮扶他人的事宜。","pronunciation":["도움"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不会做动词所指的动作。","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"656cf6c32585f66d","term":"죄송하다","zh":"抱歉，愧疚","audio":"/audio/656cf6c32585f66d3b21.mp3","entryId":"91763","definition":"好像犯了错一样感觉十分过意不去。","pronunciation":["죄ː송하다","줴ː송하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e3dc301a06e4b4598b16.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69702-1-11-2","ko":"이렇게 날 찾아와 준 것만도 나에게는 큰 위안이 돼.","zh":"你特意来找我，这对我来说已经是很大的安慰了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄹ：을/를 的缩略，标记宾语，如 뭘＝무엇을。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아와","meaning":"来找，来访，访问","explanation":"찾아오다：来找，来访，访问；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"찾아오다","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60322","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"준","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것만도","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；만：表示“只、仅”。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나에게는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"큰","meaning":"大，重大，巨大","explanation":"크다：大，重大，巨大；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"16","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위안이","meaning":"安慰，抚慰","explanation":"위안：安慰，抚慰；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"위안","audio":"/audio/29a9ffa864ead209321e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69702","senseId":"1","lemma":"위안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼.","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"367f007054a1f285","term":"찾아오다","zh":"来找，来访，访问","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3","entryId":"60322","definition":"来见某人或做某事。","pronunciation":["차자오다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"d9eb2cf86baea929","term":"크다","zh":"大，重大，巨大","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3","entryId":"66586","definition":"表示“很重要”、“很有意义”。","pronunciation":["크다"]},{"id":"29a9ffa864ead209","term":"위안","zh":"安慰，抚慰","audio":"/audio/29a9ffa864ead209321e.mp3","entryId":"69702","definition":"宽慰而使心里变舒适。","pronunciation":["위안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d9b3e719651b8a56c884.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.277,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69702","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":156,"sequenceScore":3.1037,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["很抱歉，我没能帮上忙。","你特意来找我，这对我来说已经是很大的安慰了。","您是从什么时候开始去教堂的？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["很抱歉，我没能帮上忙。","你特意来找我，这对我来说已经是很大的安慰了。","您是从什么时候开始去教堂的？"],"answer":1}]}
